Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.78,0:00:16.72,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, it doesn't get much better than that from Lilli Tagger.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N塔格尔这场打得太出色了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:19.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a performance today from the 18-year-old.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N十八岁的她 今天打得真精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:22.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Absolutely unplayable.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N简直让对手无从应对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.15,0:00:24.16,TL,,0,0,0,,女子网坛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:27.20,TL,,0,0,0,,单手打反拍的球员已经很少了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:30.39,TL,,0,0,0,,可这个姑娘 小时候就主动想练
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.39,0:00:32.13,TL,,0,0,0,,她叫莉莉 塔格尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.13,0:00:35.25,TL,,0,0,0,,如今已经站上广州决赛的舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.94,0:00:37.95,TL,,0,0,0,,小时候 她和教练约定
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.95,0:00:39.41,TL,,0,0,0,,如果赢下这次比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.41,0:00:43.48,TL,,0,0,0,,就让她改练单手反拍 后来 她赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:45.37,TL,,0,0,0,,那个小女孩想试的一拍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.37,0:00:47.99,TL,,0,0,0,,也留在了她的职业生涯里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.69,0:00:51.05,TL,,0,0,0,,塔格尔来自奥地利利恩茨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.05,0:00:52.50,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}岁开始规律练球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:54.55,TL,,0,0,0,,最初一周只有一小时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.55,0:00:56.32,TL,,0,0,0,,从儿童小球场起步
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.32,0:00:58.37,TL,,0,0,0,,她已经很喜欢往网前跑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.37,0:01:00.48,TL,,0,0,0,,主动把一分打完
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.17,0:01:02.86,TL,,0,0,0,,她在法网采访里回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.86,0:01:05.67,TL,,0,0,0,,当时并不知道换打法可能有多难
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:07.80,TL,,0,0,0,,只觉得打起来很有乐趣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.80,0:01:08.72,TL,,0,0,0,,这个选择
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.72,0:01:12.43,TL,,0,0,0,,发生在斯齐亚沃尼成为她的教练之前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.10,0:01:18.78,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But no, actually it was because I every time just felt more and more...{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N其实 是因为我越来越觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.78,0:01:22.52,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How do you say? Confident with one hand, honestly.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N怎么说呢 用单手更有信心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.22,0:01:26.08,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Which is strange because I started to play with two hands.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这挺奇妙的 因为我最初练的是双反
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.58,0:01:30.62,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But yeah, as soon as no one was watching, I just said, okay, no, I don't use the left hand.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N没人看时 我就不用左手了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.92,0:01:32.35,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2023{\fs68}年{\fs78}10{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.35,0:01:33.69,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}15{\fs68}岁的塔格尔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.69,0:01:36.29,TL,,0,0,0,,开始跟随斯齐亚沃尼训练
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.29,0:01:38.77,TL,,0,0,0,,两个人都打单手反拍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.47,0:01:40.36,TL,,0,0,0,,她的教练
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.36,0:01:43.29,TL,,0,0,0,,是最近一位单反大满贯女单冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.29,0:01:45.97,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2010{\fs68}年法网的斯齐亚沃尼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.97,0:01:48.27,TL,,0,0,0,,次年她在决赛输给李娜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.27,0:01:51.83,TL,,0,0,0,,见证亚洲首座大满贯单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.53,0:01:55.29,TL,,0,0,0,,她教塔格尔怎样把这一拍用进比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.29,0:01:58.31,TL,,0,0,0,,也教她怎样面对紧张 保持专注
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.31,0:02:00.01,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年的报道里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.01,0:02:02.67,TL,,0,0,0,,塔格尔已经在意大利生活和训练
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.67,0:02:05.22,TL,,0,0,0,,通过博尔扎诺的学校在线学习
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.22,0:02:07.41,TL,,0,0,0,,考试时再到学校
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.11,0:02:09.12,TL,,0,0,0,,喜欢网球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.12,0:02:11.85,TL,,0,0,0,,开始变成每天都要完成的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.85,0:02:13.15,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年{\fs78}3{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.15,0:02:14.55,TL,,0,0,0,,她从资格赛出发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.55,0:02:17.54,TL,,0,0,0,,拿下特拉萨赛事冠军 拿到生涯首座
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.54,0:02:20.26,TL,,0,0,0,,成人职业赛事单打奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.95,0:02:22.50,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}月来到巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.50,0:02:24.13,TL,,0,0,0,,法网青年组女单
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.13,0:02:26.54,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}场比赛 一盘未失
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.54,0:02:28.32,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.32,0:02:29.68,TL,,0,0,0,,她击败克卢格曼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.68,0:02:30.99,TL,,0,0,0,,成为奥地利第一位
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.99,0:02:33.55,TL,,0,0,0,,法网青年组单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.25,0:02:36.85,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}15{\fs68}年前 教练在这里捧杯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.85,0:02:40.31,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}15{\fs68}年后 学生赢下了青年组冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.31,0:02:42.44,TL,,0,0,0,,那是一次动人的呼应
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:43.20,TL,,0,0,0,,接下来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:46.33,TL,,0,0,0,,她还要面对成人巡回赛的考验
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:49.51,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年{\fs78}11{\fs68}月 九江
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.51,0:02:50.87,TL,,0,0,0,,塔格尔第一次打
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.87,0:02:52.84,TL,,0,0,0,,巡回赛单打正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.84,0:02:56.21,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛对面 是卫冕冠军戈卢比奇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.21,0:02:58.86,TL,,0,0,0,,巧的是 她也打单反
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.55,0:03:02.57,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘 塔格尔{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.57,0:03:03.72,TL,,0,0,0,,追回两局后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.72,0:03:07.04,TL,,0,0,0,,她仍在{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}时面对{\fs78}3{\fs68}个连续赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:09.97,TL,,0,0,0,,对手再赢一分 比赛就结束
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.24,0:03:21.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Got it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N救回来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.55,0:03:35.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Into the net it goes.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N球下网了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.45,0:03:37.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's done it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:40.31,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What an extraordinary match of tennis.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多么精彩的一场网球比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.31,0:03:45.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This has been an absolute advert for the game.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这场比赛充分展现了网球的魅力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:48.12,TL,,0,0,0,,她把{\fs78}3{\fs68}个赛点全部救了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:50.67,TL,,0,0,0,,最终{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}赢下决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.67,0:03:53.19,TL,,0,0,0,,舒展的反拍之外 人们也看到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.19,0:03:55.40,TL,,0,0,0,,她落后时仍在争取
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:57.22,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次参加巡回赛正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.22,0:04:01.28,TL,,0,0,0,,她就打进决赛 那一周最终收获亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.85,0:04:03.17,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年{\fs78}4{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.17,0:04:05.47,TL,,0,0,0,,她在本国的林茨打进八强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.47,0:04:08.22,TL,,0,0,0,,首次进入世界前{\fs78}100{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.22,0:04:10.69,TL,,0,0,0,,布拉格又给了她一次考验
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.38,0:04:15.12,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛首盘 她{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}落后于斯尼古尔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:17.80,TL,,0,0,0,,她追到{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 随后赢下抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.80,0:04:19.79,TL,,0,0,0,,再以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}拿下第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.79,0:04:22.71,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次成为巡回赛单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.69,0:04:40.77,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Lilli Tagger is the champion in Prague!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N塔格尔成为布拉格冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.77,0:04:46.67,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The Austrian teenager beaming with delight, and well she might.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奥地利小将笑了 她值得这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:53.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That was a spectacular display this week.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她本周的表现非常出色
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.05,0:04:58.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Underlined by her comeback in the opening set when she trailed 5-2.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N尤其是首盘二比五落后的逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.19,0:05:02.49,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But she wouldn't have it. She found her way back.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她不肯就此接受失利 找回了局面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.15,0:05:06.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And she found her way to glory in the Czech capital.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也在捷克首都走向了冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.41,0:05:09.86,TL,,0,0,0,,回看那次夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.86,0:05:12.19,TL,,0,0,0,,她还提到了前一周的失利
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.19,0:05:13.11,TL,,0,0,0,,到了布拉格
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.11,0:05:15.56,TL,,0,0,0,,再遇见之前击败自己的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:18.70,TL,,0,0,0,,她把从败仗里学到的东西用进了比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.70,0:05:21.07,TL,,0,0,0,,进步未必立刻换来奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.07,0:05:24.95,TL,,0,0,0,,输过的一场 也能为下一场做准备
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:28.64,TL,,0,0,0,,现在 塔格尔已经晋级广州决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.64,0:05:31.98,TL,,0,0,0,,将争取生涯第二座巡回赛单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:34.86,TL,,0,0,0,,小时候 她只说我想这样打
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:37.44,TL,,0,0,0,,走到更大的赛场 中间有教练
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:41.20,TL,,0,0,0,,有训练 也有必须自己打完的难球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.89,0:05:43.96,TL,,0,0,0,,单反给了人们记住她的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:47.35,TL,,0,0,0,,学习与成长 让她一次次走得更远
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.35,0:05:48.83,TL,,0,0,0,,你小时候很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.83,0:05:50.96,TL,,0,0,0,,后来也一直坚持的那件事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:52.81,TL,,0,0,0,,现在怎么样了？
